## GET /api/stock/{ticker}/volatility/variance-risk-premium

Variance Risk Premium

Returns variance risk premium history for a ticker. `days` selects the realized volatility horizon in
trading days. The default is 21 trading days paired with 30 calendar days of implied volatility.


