## GET /api/stock/{ticker}/volatility/variance-risk-premium/windows

Variance Risk Premium Windows

Returns every variance risk premium horizon with an implied volatility observation date in the requested
calendar lookback. `history_days` defaults to 365 and cannot exceed 365. Rows are ordered by observation
date from newest to oldest. Each row includes the realized volatility completion date.


